WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.670
Hi, and welcome to Kairo.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.030
Let me show you around.

3
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.110
This is your day at a glance:

4
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.070
every appointment, for everyone on your team, in one place.

5
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.638
Clients book themselves from your own booking page, on their phone,

6
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:18.870
any time of day, and it lands straight in your calendar.

7
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.141
Each client keeps their visits and notes, like colour formulas,

8
00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:25.940
and your dashboard shows how the week's tracking.

9
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.980
And there's no chasing anyone.

10
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.376
Kairo emails your clients before and after every visit,

11
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:33.980
with your name on it,

12
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.340
and it's free.

13
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.070
Want text reminders as well?

14
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.960
There's a one-minute video for that, whenever you're ready.

15
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.450
Right, let's get your business set up.

16
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.260
It only takes about five minutes.
